{"seq":1,"slug":"topological-data-analysis","title":"拓扑数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/algebraic-topology/practice/topological-data-analysis","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"拓扑数据分析\">拓扑数据分析</h1><p>给你一团散落在高维空间里的数据点——比如一万个细胞的基因表达向量，或一段蛋白质的构象轨迹。它们暗藏着某种「形状」：是一个环？两个分离的团？还是一个空心球壳？均值、方差、PCA 这些经典统计量看不见形状，它们只描述数据的「位置和散布」，不描述「拓扑」。拓扑数据分析（TDA）把 <a href=\"../homology/simplicial-homology\">单纯同调</a> 的数洞机器搬到含噪点云上，量化数据在不同尺度下的洞，给出对噪声和坐标变换都稳健的形状特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从点云到持续同调\">核心概念：从点云到持续同调</h2><p>单个点云没有现成的单纯复形，TDA 的第一步是<strong>用一个尺度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 把点连成复形</strong>。最常用的是 Vietoris–Rips 复形：以每个点为中心画半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的球，任意一组两两距离都 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的点就张成一个单纯形。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0 慢慢增大，复形从「一堆孤立点」逐渐长成「连通的块、出现环、环被填上」——这是一串嵌套的复形，叫<strong>过滤</strong>(filtration)。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 算同调太浪费，关键洞见是追踪<strong>每个洞的诞生与死亡尺度</strong>。一个环在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出现（birth）、在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon=\\varepsilon_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被填上（death），记成平面上一个点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon_b,\\varepsilon_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。所有洞画成的散点图叫<strong>持续图</strong>(persistence diagram)，离对角线越远的点（寿命 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_d-\\varepsilon_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越长）越可能是真实结构，贴着对角线的是噪声。这就是<strong>持续同调</strong>(persistent homology)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[高维点云] --&gt; B[尺度 ε 从 0 增大]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Vietoris-Rips 过滤&lt;br/&gt;嵌套单纯复形序列]&#10;    C --&gt; D[追踪每个洞的诞生 ε_b 与死亡 ε_d]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;持续图: 平面上的点 #40;ε_b, ε_d#41;&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[远离对角线 = 真实结构]&#10;    E --&gt; G[贴近对角线 = 噪声]\">flowchart TD\n    A[高维点云] --&gt; B[尺度 ε 从 0 增大]\n    B --&gt; C[Vietoris-Rips 过滤&lt;br/&gt;嵌套单纯复形序列]\n    C --&gt; D[追踪每个洞的诞生 ε_b 与死亡 ε_d]\n    D --&gt; E[\"持续图: 平面上的点 #40;ε_b, ε_d#41;\"]\n    E --&gt; F[远离对角线 = 真实结构]\n    E --&gt; G[贴近对角线 = 噪声]</pre><p>下表把持续同调的三个维度与它们捕捉的形状对应起来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>捕捉的特征</td>\n<td>连通分支（聚类）</td>\n<td>环 / 循环</td>\n<td>空腔 / 空心球壳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据例子</td>\n<td>几个分离的细胞群</td>\n<td>周期性轨迹的环</td>\n<td>蛋白质口袋空腔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诞生事件</td>\n<td>点出现</td>\n<td>环路闭合</td>\n<td>球壳合拢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡事件</td>\n<td>两分支相连</td>\n<td>环被三角形填满</td>\n<td>空腔被填实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"稳定性定理-tda-为何可信\">稳定性定理：TDA 为何可信</h2><p>TDA 能成为严肃工具而非玄学，靠的是<strong>稳定性定理</strong>：输入点云的微小扰动，只会引起持续图的微小变化（在 bottleneck 距离意义下，持续图的变化不超过输入扰动的大小）。换句话说，持续图对噪声 Lipschitz 连续——这是经典 <a href=\"../foundations/topological-invariants\">拓扑不变量</a> 的「同伦不变」在含噪、有尺度的数据世界里的定量版本。</p>\n<p>稳定性还附带坐标无关性：旋转、平移数据不改变成对距离，因此不改变持续图。这让 TDA 特别适合那些「形状有意义但坐标系任意」的场景——分子构象、传感器网络、神经活动流形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把持续图喂给机器学习\">把持续图喂给机器学习</h2><p>持续图是一个点的集合，不是固定长度的向量，没法直接塞进神经网络或 SVM。2020 年代 TDA 与机器学习融合的核心工作就是<strong>向量化</strong>持续图：把它转成固定维度的特征。主流方法包括持续景观(persistence landscape)、持续图像(persistence image)，以及 2024 年起流行的 TDAvec 等向量化包提供的多种统计向量化。</p>\n<p>得到向量后，TDA 特征可作为任何下游模型的输入，或作为深度网络里的<strong>拓扑损失</strong>——在图像分割中惩罚「分割结果的洞数与真实不符」，强制网络输出拓扑正确的掩膜。这条「拓扑特征 + 标准 ML」的范式属于 <a href=\"../../category-theory/applications/category-theory-in-cs\">范畴论</a> 之外的工程实践，本篇只点明它如今已是 TDA 落地的主干。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[持续图&lt;br/&gt;变长点集] --&gt; B[向量化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[持续景观]&#10;    B --&gt; D[持续图像]&#10;    B --&gt; E[统计向量 TDAvec 等]&#10;    C --&gt; F[固定长度特征向量]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[下游 ML: 分类/回归/聚类]&#10;    F --&gt; H[深度网络拓扑损失]\">graph TD\n    A[持续图&lt;br/&gt;变长点集] --&gt; B[向量化]\n    B --&gt; C[持续景观]\n    B --&gt; D[持续图像]\n    B --&gt; E[统计向量 TDAvec 等]\n    C --&gt; F[固定长度特征向量]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[下游 ML: 分类/回归/聚类]\n    F --&gt; H[深度网络拓扑损失]</pre><h2 id=\"2026-年的工具与应用现状\">2026 年的工具与应用现状</h2><p>截至 2026 年，TDA 已有成熟的开源工具栈。Python 生态里 <strong>GUDHI</strong>（C++ 内核、Python 接口，功能最全）、<strong>Ripser / giotto-ph</strong>（Vietoris–Rips 持续同调的高速计算）、<strong>giotto-tda</strong>（与 scikit-learn 无缝集成，便于接入 ML 流水线）是三大主力，scikit-tda、Dionysus 2 等补充其余需求（<a href=\"https://github.com/FatemehTarashi/awesome-tda\">GUDHI/Ripser/giotto-tda 概览</a>）。</p>\n<p>应用上，TDA 在单细胞生物学（用持续同调刻画细胞分化轨迹的环状/分叉结构，见 <a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12436302/\">2025 单细胞 TDA 综述</a>）、材料科学（晶体与非晶材料的孔隙结构）、神经科学、复杂网络等领域持续扩张。2025 年 Springer《Artificial Intelligence Review》的综述还指出，研究正从单纯的持续同调走向更广的「拓扑深度学习」，把同调思想嵌进网络结构本身（<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10462-025-11462-w\">TDA 与拓扑深度学习综述, 2025</a>）。这些计算的底层引擎与性能优化，在 <a href=\"computational-topology\">计算拓扑</a> 一篇详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TDA 把单纯同调搬到含噪点云：用尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 构造 Vietoris–Rips 过滤，追踪洞的诞生与死亡。</li>\n<li>持续图把每个洞画成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon_b,\\varepsilon_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，远离对角线者为真实结构，贴近者为噪声。</li>\n<li>稳定性定理保证持续图对扰动 Lipschitz 连续、对坐标变换不变，是 TDA 可信的理论基石。</li>\n<li>持续图经向量化（景观、图像、TDAvec 等）后可喂给标准 ML，或作为深度网络的拓扑损失。</li>\n<li>2026 年主力工具为 GUDHI、Ripser/giotto-ph、giotto-tda；应用扩张至单细胞生物学、材料、神经科学。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同一章的 <a href=\"computational-topology\">计算拓扑</a>：持续同调背后的约化算法、复杂度与大规模实现。</li>\n<li>同一章的 <a href=\"fixed-point-theorems\">不动点定理</a>：同调的另一类应用——用拓扑给出存在性证明。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../../data-science/dimensionality-reduction/manifold-learning/umap\">数据科学 · 流形学习 UMAP</a> 与 TDA 同样关注高维数据的「形状」，是互补的降维视角。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拓扑数据分析","id":"拓扑数据分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从点云到持续同调","id":"核心概念-从点云到持续同调"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定性定理：TDA 为何可信","id":"稳定性定理-tda-为何可信"},{"level":2,"text":"把持续图喂给机器学习","id":"把持续图喂给机器学习"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的工具与应用现状","id":"2026-年的工具与应用现状"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"上同调与对偶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/algebraic-topology/homology/cohomology-duality"},"next":{"title":"不动点定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/algebraic-topology/practice/fixed-point-theorems"}}